#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/net-tools.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>export BINDIR='/usr/bin' SBINDIR='/usr/bin'</command>: Ensure the "
